# SymbiYosys working directories.
#
# Each task gets one named for the .sby file and the task -- prove_good/,
# prove_bad1/ -- and sby also keeps a shared status database in a bare
# directory named for the .sby file alone.
prove/
prove_*/
probe/
probe_*/

# The scratch copy `make solution' builds, with the reference property
# file swapped in.
.ref/

*.vcd
